  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"42\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"40\" data-start=\"4\">Panenka Prints Affiliate Program</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"76\" data-start=\"44\"><strong data-end=\"74\" data-start=\"49\">📢 Brand Introduction</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"297\" data-start=\"77\">Panenka Prints is a football-inspired apparel brand, creating high-quality embroidered T-shirts, hoodies, and caps. Our designs celebrate legendary players, iconic celebrations, and the nostalgia of the beautiful game.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"299\"><strong data-end=\"330\" data-start=\"304\">👕 Product Description</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"367\" data-start=\"333\">We offer a unique collection of:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"368\">\r\n<li data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"368\"><strong data-end=\"404\" data-start=\"370\">Embroidered T-shirts &amp; Hoodies</strong> &ndash; Premium quality with football-inspired designs.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"457\"><strong data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"459\">Caps &amp; Accessories</strong> &ndash; Terrace culture meets modern football fashion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"534\"><strong data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"539\">🔥 Unique Selling Points (USP)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"818\" data-start=\"576\">\r\n<li data-end=\"635\" data-start=\"576\"><strong data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"578\">Nostalgic, football-inspired designs</strong> loved by fans.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"636\"><strong data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"638\">Premium embroidery</strong> on high-quality materials.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"690\"><strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"692\">Perfect for collectors &amp; fashion-conscious football lovers.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"818\" data-start=\"758\"><strong data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"760\">Worldwide shipping</strong> &ndash; reaching fans across the globe.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"847\" data-start=\"820\"><strong data-end=\"845\" data-start=\"825\">💰 Payment Terms</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"848\">\r\n<li data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"848\">Earn <strong data-end=\"873\" data-start=\"855\">10% commission</strong> on every sale made through your unique affiliate link.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"931\">Payments are made <strong data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"951\">monthly via PayPal</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"977\">No minimum payout &ndash; get rewarded for every sale!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"1031\"><strong data-end=\"1060\" data-start=\"1036\">ℹ️ Other Information</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1454\" data-start=\"1063\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1142\" data-start=\"1063\">Affiliates receive a <strong data-end=\"1110\" data-start=\"1086\">custom discount code</strong> to share with their audience.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1143\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1155\">football content creators, nostalgia pages, and sports influencers</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1288\" data-start=\"1229\">Affiliates can use our <strong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1254\">product shots</strong> for promotion.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1454\" data-start=\"1289\"><strong data-end=\"1336\" data-start=\"1291\">Montages of footballers, clips, and edits</strong> can be used for marketing, but affiliates must <strong data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1384\">source their own content</strong> from platforms like TikTok and YouTube.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1459\" data-start=\"1456\">\r\n<p data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1534\" data-start=\"1461\">👉 <strong data-end=\"1531\" data-start=\"1464\">Ready to join? Apply now and start earning with Panenka Prints!</strong> 🚀</p>",
